  "description": "Elizabeth is in an unwanted engagement with Kenneth, an arrogant man whose good looks do nothing to improve her opinion of him. She finds solace in a secret friendship with Lawrence, a mysterious man who lives in the manor next door, but is only there at night. As she gets to know both men better, she develops feelings for both of them and soon finds herself with her life on the line, caught in a love triangle between a vampire and a vampire hunter.\n\n(Source: Webtoons)",
